OL,3,ATen climbers missing after avalanche
OL,4,Ahits Himalayan base camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 10 Nepalese climbers who were
OL,7,Fpreparing to lead an expedition in the
OL,8,FHimalayas are missing after an
OL,9,Favalanche hit a base camp on Sunday
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,12,FThe climb's organisers said the local
OL,13,Fguides were at a staging point close to
OL,14,Fthe Himlung Himal peak in Manang
OL,15,Fdistrict when the avalanche struck.
OL,17,FForecasts showed there was heavy
OL,18,Fsnowfall around the 7,126m (23,380ft)
OL,19,Fpeak in recent days, which lies on
OL,20,FNepal's border with Tibet.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
