OL,3,ATen climbers missing after avalanche
OL,4,Ahits Himalayan base camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoor weather has hampered rescue
OL,7,Fefforts, with helicopters and rescue
OL,8,Fteams unable to reach the site.
